msgctxt "176_Sodachi"
msgid "I tell you, it's wonderful to see the apprentices training together. It's just beautiful."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "188_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah. It is."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "200_Sodachi"
msgid "Hehe. If they kept just practicing amongst themselves, I wouldn't have to do a thing!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "212_Sodachi"
msgid "Heheheheh..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "236_Tokita"
msgid "Give me a break!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "248_Saejima"
msgid "Hm? What's the matter?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "260_Tokita"
msgid "This guy isn't even trying. Hmph! You'd better stop treating me like some idiot!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "272_Watanabe"
msgid "But, that's not what I'm doing..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "284_Tokita"
msgid "I've had enough! I don't want to see your face anymore!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "296_Tokita"
msgid "This just makes me sick... I'm going home!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "320_Sodachi"
msgid "Wow, looks like you pissed off Tokita-kun pretty good."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "332_Watanabe"
msgid "But I didn't mean to... I just wanted Tokita-san to enjoy his sparring..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "344_Sodachi"
msgid "So, you took it easy on him?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
msgctxt "356_Watanabe"
msgid "Yeah... I thought it was a good idea. I was just trying to be nice. I don't understand what happened."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "368_Saejima"
msgid "Hmph. 'Course he's angry. Tokita was tryin' to have a serious match with you. And ya sold him short."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Watanabe"
msgid "...!"
msgstr "¡...!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "392_Saejima"
msgid "Makin' someone look good ain't always gonna go over well with 'em. You should remember that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "404_Watanabe"
msgid "I understand..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "416_Watanabe"
msgid "I thought it would be good for him, but I guess I wasn't really thinking about his feelings."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "428_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he figured out his mistake. Guess it was a good talk.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "440_Saejima"
msgid "You're a nice guy. But that didn't work for ya this time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "452_Watanabe"
msgid "I'll never forgive myself for this. But what did I do wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "464_Watanabe"
msgid "How am I supposed to act around Tokita-san from now on?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "476_Saejima"
msgid "(Maybe I shoulda been more clear... Seems like he's even more depressed than before.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "488_Saejima"
msgid "That ain't kindness."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "500_Watanabe"
msgid "What do you mean!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "512_Saejima"
msgid "If ya wanna be kind, you gotta take the feelin's of others into consideration."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "524_Saejima"
msgid "Did ya even think about why Tokita wanted to fight ya?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "536_Watanabe"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "548_Saejima"
msgid "He wanted to have a serious match with ya. But you didn't take 'im seriously. Ya just took it easy on 'im."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "560_Saejima"
msgid "Hmph. 'Course he's angry."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "572_Watanabe"
msgid "I see... I just forced my own definition of \"kindness\" on him without thinking about his feelings."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "584_Watanabe"
msgid "Maybe I've been running away from having to face people. I'm going to go apologize to Tokita-san!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "596_Saejima"
msgid "(Good. Looks like he's realized his mistake.)"
msgstr ""

